It was an honor to speak at @TAMU's inaugural Civil Discourse Symposium, which also featured VP @Mike_Pence.

@RepCuellar and I discussed how we work across the aisle to get good things done for the American people. As I always say, when we disagree, we can do so with civility.

Proud of the Aggies for leading the charge to revive civil discourse across our nation!
